  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>BUCKS PAYS</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>BASE BET: 40</size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>BUCKS PAYS</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: "<size=20>\n- Win the total sum of all Bucks Symbols that appear on the\n   
      spots.\n- Bucks Pay range varies according to the player's bet level. \n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_5_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>FLAMIN' HOT LINK BONUS</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_5_1
    value: "<size=18>\n- 4 or more Bucks Symbols anywhere on reels triggers Flamin'
      Hot Link\n    Bonus.\n- In Flamin' Hot Link Bonus, Bucks Symbol and Mystery
      Symbol \n    can appear.\n- Flamin' Hot Link Bonus consists of 8x5 reelsets
      with upper 4x5\n    locked.\n- Unlock Count on a row is the required amount
      of symbols to collect,\n    to unlock such row.\n    - When Flamin' Hot Link
      Bonus is triggered, count the triggering\n        Bucks Symbols and deduct
      the same amount from the Unlock\n        Count.\n- In locked rows, symbols
      do appear but are excluded for Unlock Count.\n- If a row is unlocked and one
      or more symbols exist, then count such\n    symbols and deduct them from the
      Unlock Count.\n- Flamin' Hot Link Bonus ends when there is no remaining spin.\n-
      At the end, Mystery Symbol spins and determines the prize.\n    - Mystery Symbol
      can award Mini, Minor, Major, Mega Jackpot or\n       Credit Value.\n- Fully
      filled 40 spots awards Grand Jackpot.\n</size>"
